      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1908-05-02_WidnesExaminer_art0026" n="art0026">
        <head>THEN ADVISED AMPUTATION,</head>
        <p>THEN ADVISED AMPUTATION,</p>
        <p>saying nothing could save the limb. "1 had then been suffering for eight years, and began to lose all hope. I used ordinary ointments, lotions and poultices, but nothing would ease the pain or stop the continual discharge. I cried many a time with the cruel torturing...pain. The ulcers had eaten so deeply into the flesh that you could actually see the shin-bone about five inches long, as clean as my hand. " About this time, when I was in a truly pitiable condition, I read in the local papers about Zam-Buk's great success in similar cases and thought I would give it a trial. The utmost I then hoped for was ease from that terrible pain. I sent for a box. After bathing the wound, I dressed it with the balm. Zam-Buk was so cool and refreshing that I there and then decided to give it a good trial. I continued the bathing and dressing, and the pain became easier , day by day, the discharge ZAM-BUKI THE GREAT SAFEGUARD. stopped. and the wound gradually began to heal up. s Zam-Buk's success must appeal forcibly to the minds of I was astonished, and so was thousands who have witnessed small and apparently trivial everybody who knew me, wounds develop by slow degrees into huge, festering sores, to see the wonderful change full of fire and inflammation, and marked by intense and pain- Zam-Buk was working. ful swelling of adjacent tissues. The first cause of trouble " With the continued may be a mere scratch sustained in the course of one's daily dressings of Zam-Buk my round of home duties, or it may be a knock or a bruise at one's leg improved until all the work just sufficient to break the surface skin and expose the inflammation and pain had delicate under-tissues to all the injurious actions of the dusty died away, the discharge had s and germ-laden air. When blood-poison is feared or suspected quite ceased, and the wound it is a wise plan to dress the wound closed right up, with new freely with Zam-Buk, whose anti- and healthy skin. My leg is , septic juices quickly race after the no was sound a, ever it was." dangerous germs and destroy them.</p>
