        <p>" I have been perfectly well</p>
        <p>Cured since my cure by your 18 Months. pills," said Mrs. Lucy Selby,</p>
        <p>52, Devonshire-place, Thel- wall-lane, Latchford, Warrington, nearly eighteen months after telling of her cure. " Many know how ill I was, and remarked how different I looked afterwards. I became quite strong with the use of Doan's Pills, and six boxes of them cured me."</p>
        <p>Here is what Mrs. Selby told us just after her cure:—" I was so ill with kidney com- plaint for five years that I didn't know what to do for the best. I have many a time k3en doubled up with the pains, which were round my loins, and I did not know how to straighten myself. My head ached so badly at times that I could scarcely see. The doctor told me I was suffering from kidney disease, but I got no better under his treatment. " Hearing of Doan's backache kidney pills, I got some to try. Now I can truthfully say they have done me more good than anything else I ever used. (Signed) L. SELBY."</p>
